   "widgets_values": [
    "## starter 04 \u00b7 animate the windows\n\n**You need:** LTX 2.5 (distilled transformer, the Gemma text encoder, video + audio VAE, the x2 spatial\nupscaler; the int8 files fit a 12 GB GPU). Other builds: pick them in nodes 10-14.\n\n**Do:** Queue. Only the windows of floors 1 and 2 move (`animate = on` in the plan), the facade stays still.\nA 5 s clip takes a few minutes. Queue again unchanged: the clips come from the cache.\n\n**Then try:** `video_prompt` per window group, `t_start` / `t_end` (seconds) per rule, `motion` 0-1; the director\n(starter 03) as the background with a timeline.\n"
   ],
   "title": "read me"
  }
